  "usage_note": "**Thank you** is also the usual answer to a compliment or a good wish (*\"You look great.\" \"Thank you.\"*). Common replies to it are *you're welcome*, *no problem*, and *my pleasure*. The noun **thank-you**, with a hyphen, is a separate entry (*a thank-you card*).",
